# Secure allow-list for Cloudflare Workers Static Assets
# Everything not explicitly allowed must stay OUT of the public web bundle.
# This prevents SQL migrations, Supabase Edge code, docs and repository files
# from being served by workers.dev. Keep this list narrow.
*
!/index.html
!/config.js
!/assets/
!/assets/app.js
!/assets/styles.css
!/assets/ot-form-generator.js
!/assets/Overtime_Form_Template.xlsx
